{"study_accession":"PRJNA785486","secondary_study_accession":"SRP348879","title":"Time-Resolved Gene Expression Analysis Monitors the Regulation of Inflammatory Mediators and Attenuation of Adaptive Immune Response by Vitamin D","description":"In this study, we focused on the time-course of transcriptional changes in freshly isolated human PBMCs 4, 8, 24 and 48 h after onset of stimulation with the active vitamin D metabolite 1α,25-dihydroxyvitamin D3 (1,25(OH)2D3) compared to vehicle (0.1% EtOH). Overall design: PBMCs of a healthy male donor were isolated within one hour after peripheral blood collection and exposed for 4, 8, 24 or 48 h to either 10 nM 1α,25-dihydroxyvitamin D3 or solvent (0.1% EtOH). All experiments were performed in three repeats. Total RNA was extracted and subjected to RNA-seq analysis.","pubmed":"35055093;40735310","geo_series":"","n_samples":24,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN23563653","study_accession":"PRJNA785486","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"10 nM 1,25(OH)2D3, 04 h, rep1","description":"10 nM 1,25(OH)2D3, 04 h, rep1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5710829","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-01-28","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["cell_type","PBMC"],["compound","10 nM 1,25(OH)2D3"],["timepoint","4 h"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR17091048","experiment_accession":"SRX13279001","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":22848640,"base_count":1942134400,"first_public":"2022-01-28","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM5710829: 10 nM 1,25(OH)2D3, 04 h, rep1 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN23563654","study_accession":"PRJNA785486","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"10 nM 1,25(OH)2D3, 04 h, rep2","description":"10 nM 1,25(OH)2D3, 04 h, rep2","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5710830","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-01-28","attributes":[["source_